{"availability":"available","full":"Lugia123/polter","name":"polter","description":"A terminal where one Claude Code session supervises the AI agents in your other tabs: which is stuck, which is done, which is still running. Group chat, task panel and MCP tools for multi-agent work. Built on Ghostty.","category":"Productivity","language":"Zig","stars":17,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-18T03:07:04Z","updated":"2026-10-11T02:52:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["agent-harness","agent-orchestration","ai-agents","ai-coding-assistant","claude-code","cli","developer-tools","ghostty","macos","mcp","model-context-protocol","multi-agent","orchestrator-worker","terminal","terminal-native","windows"],"demo":"https://lugia123.github.io/polter/?lang=en","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.040Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.040Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.040Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.040Z","stars":17,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A terminal multiplexer and orchestrator for AI agents.","Put one Claude Code session in charge of the others. Polter is a terminal that lets you run multiple coding agents in parallel. One agent acts as the Supervisor: via MCP, it reads the screens of other tabs, types into them, opens new tabs, and manages them while you step away.","Running multiple Claude Code or Codex windows at the same time is hard to manage. Sub-agents often stop working halfway through a long task, or an overnight job gets stuck after a few hours waiting for input."],"features":["Smart Supervisor: The supervisor agent can read the text on any tab (real text, not screenshots), type commands into any tab, and open new tabs to start new agents.","Team Management: It can create a group chat, assign tasks, and receive reports. This task panel survives a terminal restart.","Idle Detection: Polter tracks how long each screen has been inactive and tells the supervisor if a worker is stuck.","Roles & Projects: Save your favorite agent settings (skills, prompts, models) as Roles. Save your workspace (tabs, directories, history) as Projects and load them later (macOS and Windows only).","Hooks: A Claude Code started from a Role tells Polter when its turn ends and what it said. The supervisor is notified directly, rather than waiting to read a still screen. (Claude Code only; other CLIs are monitored by…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lugia123/polter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9732be212af8265229a1aae25293329ee36ee20c726539e6ffd8a54a2aed3946","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.117Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.117Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A terminal multiplexer and orchestrator for AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lugia123/polter/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9732be212af8265229a1aae25293329ee36ee20c726539e6ffd8a54a2aed3946","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lugia123/polter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.118Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T02:52:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lugia123/polter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:37.119Z","hash":"9732be212af8265229a1aae25293329ee36ee20c726539e6ffd8a54a2aed3946","originalBytes":13887,"storedBytes":13887,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["polter","terminal","supervisor","claude","agent","what","long","one","windows","code","how","mcp","only","tabs","macos","read","screen","session","agents","run","screenshot","each","file","project","screenshots","settings","tab","task","text","tools","been","ghostty","here","other","path","poltergeist","start","tmux","tool","via","whether","won","chat","click","default","dev-docs","faq","feature","independent","open","parent","permissions.","plugins","projects","prompts","set","they","when","worker","worktree","annotations","answ